{"group_identity":"40755a14a8c43c784362a7881bf197610b6688142b6210318f46a48530aa80de","payload":{"attempt":1,"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1_lane_group","cycle":0,"group_id":"group-000","lane_boundaries":[{"index":1,"length":20,"offset":0},{"index":2,"length":20,"offset":20},{"index":3,"length":20,"offset":40},{"index":4,"length":20,"offset":60}],"lane_count":4,"lanes":[{"candidate_identity":"cf26daedd8f73270bc8d35cd6d378f3b0ef5399fc20f4e90a5b1d49dbac64215","dispatch_id":"lane-000-0","index":1,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-5e2173dbfb90012ff34d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-0.json"},{"candidate_identity":"6ec6be8775a35e71f4127e29f5d77ad3651784d68e71f73357673813290fee81","dispatch_id":"lane-000-1","index":2,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-5e2173dbfb90012ff34d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-1.json"},{"candidate_identity":"1ca51afc0ffe22ebe92ced8fd0a6de3e82ad890357beae6d3569b792c6569209","dispatch_id":"lane-000-2","index":3,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-5e2173dbfb90012ff34d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-2.json"},{"candidate_identity":"299b5da910cc33bce272b2a10d0c2e2357dc397440ab706f0fefc78b5d43d236","dispatch_id":"lane-000-3","index":4,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-5e2173dbfb90012ff34d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-3.json"}],"review_phase":"REVIEW","task_id":"batch-5e2173dbfb90012ff34d","workset":{"entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07ac4ccb7c9dc98ee3fd51033639bfc2592738e3ff6583791b3805fa8d28eb89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"032814aff9f8a61b5cc02e6922e421c7533b699fe9f99cda035b4a86a1e8ef05","logical_entry_identity":"eca7705d97359b8736f0f58ac4f4a37503cd017c5cd618a0c37d189dfbe45fd8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A bulging rotten robe seems to tear at the seams, with masses of bloated worms spilling out all around the moving form.  Two arm-like appendages, each made up of overlapping mucous-drenched maggots, grasp tightly around the handles of bile-coated waraxes.\nEach swing drips pustulant fluid before it, and each droplet writhes and wriggles in the air before splashing against the ground.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一件鼓鼓囊囊的腐烂长袍，长袍的缝隙里不断蠕动着浮肿的蠕虫。它有着两只臂膀一样的附属物，每只都由沾满黏液的蛆重叠而成，各握着一柄覆有胆汁的斧子。\n每一次挥舞都会向前溅出脓液，每一滴脓液在空中扭动翻滚，然后啪嗒一声落在地上。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60529070c95a320e16afc926d31a0457ec59cfd4e911c2567a4243758c71676e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"088e30b8f42fbae3ba509b354328b690df88b1c74348f9aee184d6c252707c63","logical_entry_identity":"ef9ace3680ec1855d4d80d1b68bc3b5a4daa7e39ee572033c7af854f5de0accd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a %d%% chance to fire off a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, evading it and dealing %d%% archery damage.\n\t\tThis cannot damage the same target more than once per turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个技能将你的反应提升到令人难以置信的水平。每当你被近身攻击，你有 %d%% 几率射出一箭拦截攻击，躲闪攻击并造成 %d%% 弓箭伤害。\n\t\t每回合对同一目标最多造成一次伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9955277309209451fb946fd8787872c78e9c829cc445150adba71d3211783d86","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0c3585e4829f65c6e850fd4c50d4efc281b5900c2492de2528f5d9a6dcceef98","logical_entry_identity":"545299565a8fcfc8999b3db9f43c1bfe819d07b2dab7e548ba56f973b3e17008","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Through some terrible process that remains mysterious, this creature's shadow has been torn from its body and given unlife.","source_tag":"_t","target":"通过某种神秘的可怕手段，这只生物的影子被从身体上剥离出来，并被赋予了亡灵般的存在。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d2a0ba6e709c52fc613408a3efd948620236daeacbef7fc3b7e0c701ae931ff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0fdff27cc328745dc88def4da27c211e28a2fc15e235058bec89f4b80797eabb","logical_entry_identity":"e365a648b347f8ff3392466ec1ba214a8a673c606ac4ccbf5a4981e095539bf6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The dwarves are an exceptionally secretive and quiet race, reluctant to talk about themselves to outsiders unless hefty bribes are paid. Many times in their history they have cut off all contact with the other races for no known reason, shutting tight the great iron doors that cover the trade passages to their mines and their cavernous cities. However of late they have become more open with the outside world, and I have even had the pleasure of receiving the unique distinction of being allowed to enter their main city, the Iron Throne, and speaking with several of their guild leaders.\n\nDwarves are around 5' tall, with generally brown or grey hair. They are usually stocky and muscular, and known to be very resistant to any physical suffering. Their females can be hard to distinguish from their males, but can usually be identified by the beads braided into their beards. All dwarves are highly proud of their beards, and take immaculate care of them. The greatest insult to a dwarf is to belittle his beard, and the greatest sign of suffering in a dwarf is for him to tear at his beard.\n\nDwarves are known especially for their smithwork and artificing, which is unrivalled amongst all the other races. They also make cunning merchants, known to drive a hard bargain. Their society consists of a fairly strict caste system, with families belonging to guilds of miners, smelters, craftsmen, and so on, and deviance into work outside of one's guild of birth is almost unheard of. However there is no perceived inequality between guilds, with each having equal representation on their ruling Committee of Guilds. Who actually acts as figurehead is unknown to outsiders though, and no amount of bribing will encourage any dwarf to speak on the subject. When it is mentioned in passing their allusions to a leader are normally marked by an almost religious reverence.\n\nTheir skill with metal is renowned above all else. Dwarven steel is considered the most durable material for use in construction, and dwarves are the finest workers with stralite and voratun, precious metals of immense value. They trade heavily in their crafts from their capital the Iron Throne, but allow no outsiders in - instead they send innumerable merchant caravans out to all the cities to ply their wares.\n\nAs well as the many merchant dwarves one may meet there are also a great deal of young dwarves who venture beyond their halls of stone. These are generally of adventuring fare, and it is encouraged in dwarven society to experience something of the wider world in one's younger years. This is known to them as being \"smithed upon the anvil of the world\". In private though some senior dwarves admit that this activity is promoted to help with their \"market research strategy\".","source_tag":"_t","target":"矮人是非常神秘且低调的种族，一般来说，除非你给他们点好处，否则他们不会谈论任何与己有关的事。历史上，他们曾经多次无缘无故的切断和外界的联系，落下的钢铁大门隔绝了外界的交易通道以及通往他们矿井和地下城市的道路。不过，之后他们会对外界积极开放，我甚至很荣幸的得到了去他们的首都——钢铁王座游玩的资格，并有幸与他们的主要领导人对话。\n\n矮人们基本身高在5英尺左右，有着棕色或灰色的头发。他们通常有着施瓦辛格般的肌肉和体魄，并以超强的物理抵抗能力而闻名于世。他们的性别通常较难区分，但可以通过绑成珠状的胡须来区分。所有的矮人都非常自豪于他们的大胡子，并且对他们的胡子非常爱护。对于矮人来说，贬低他的胡子就是最大的侮辱，而矮人极度痛苦时会撕扯自己的胡子。\n\n矮人擅长锻造和精工，这一点在所有种族中都是无与伦比的。他们同时精于商业，擅长讨价还价。他们的社会有着相当严格的等级制度，家庭通常会隶属于矿业协会、提炼协会、锻造协会等等，脱离协会的个人几乎从未听说过。不过，在协会之间几乎没有贫富差距，各行业公会在统治委员会中拥有平等的代表权。矮人的信仰是不为外界所知的，再多的金钱也不能使他们吐露分毫信息。当你提及这方面的问题时，他们暗示着过去的某个领袖几乎被他们看成了一种信仰般的存在。\n\n他们对金属的提炼也是举世闻名的。矮人钢被认为是制造业中最有价值的材料，并且矮人们同样善于使用斯莱特和沃瑞钽，可以使其发挥出最大的价值。他们在首都——钢铁王座中进行大量的交易，但是从不欢迎外来者——相反，他们会指派商人们到各个城市去售卖货物。\n\n在众多的矮人商人出现的同时，越来越多的年轻矮人更加倾向于从他们的石头洞穴里出去冒险。他们一般以探险为业，在矮人社会中，一个人在年轻的时候出去闯荡是值得鼓励和赞扬的。矮人称这种经历为在”世界之砧”上锤炼自己。不过私下里，一些成年矮人承认推广这项活动是为了帮助他们的”市场调查策略”。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f29ca296f48a2af8fb1c4a8e731ec2e7b7eec23c9642135c2fd80759ec39d12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"34da71654c8683072545ac35805bce34b8f45aa47a8b16c6e9fd2f5c8c48345a","logical_entry_identity":"0491e2117dac7ea750aa395959b0ae721f1122727138b73511cd44078abe83d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A gaunt vaguely humanoid shape featuring unadorned grey leathery skin. Its arms and legs seem somehow too long and it stands tall, projecting an ominous shadow even in darkness.\nIts glowing red eyes shine with both cruelty and a deep frightening intellect.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个憔悴、隐约近似人类的身影，全身是未经修饰的灰色皮革质地的皮肤。它的胳膊和腿不知为何过于修长。当它耸立在那里的时候，即使在黑暗中也会投下不祥的阴影。\n它发光的红色眼睛闪烁着，目光里蕴含着既残酷又深邃可怕的智慧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6d1e1fd6a62959cb956df2b6366fdde58efc3c81d6ff1e7ffad2b21bc097203","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"433fa1ca67b8f0883140f8a43e4cdf4a2f550d673df9312e9b5338d0f977a326","logical_entry_identity":"9af107420fd99eb82b060236814e8eaa90eb8006de3685a5838777d6b9e06e67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Focus kinetic energy and strike an enemy for %d%% weapon damage as physical.\n\t\tThey will be pinned to the ground for %d turns by the force of this attack.\n\t\tAny frozen creature hit by this attack will take an extra %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tThe extra damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"聚焦动能打击敌人，造成 %d%% 武器物理伤害。\n\t\t敌人将被这次攻击的力量定身 %d 回合。\n\t\t任何处于冻结状态的目标受到额外 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t额外伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4bda9b7fa47b516b0e0996df0382eb0cbe04b1d0c8c16a2e48812a048d433bed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56ea8516600747a86afed1e2520d718624ba0413d8f40c050e3e89e59b143dd9","logical_entry_identity":"22ef0de72582387cf1a76eea641200acfcfe1fbd08999944efca68b5da47bce8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This fez once belonged to a traveler; it always seems to be found lying around in odd locations.\n#{italic}#Fezzes are cool.#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"这顶菲斯帽曾属于一位旅行家；它似乎总是出现在各种古怪的地方。\n#{italic}#菲斯帽很酷。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fa5627b3da67a5a4dd078ff9e1b910685c42d19f513562d8a382c2f729c9b589","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a3ebc3ece8c794e063822dfb1983ca9444b1051ed01c2f2cf939f22c32659b0","logical_entry_identity":"050f91103c282576f6c489c7fa491fa196b700ec56bccbcdbf4483ab3ab32830","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is entangled in razorwire!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被刀片刺网缠住！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a7fbb711527b52f6e98aff32dd3228baaf6ce13d5836e850419a8c306d16385","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"678945553ec0351a76f8becc4ad6dcf7e56e72f230a1f3d4de6c26090adfc715","logical_entry_identity":"f886f22c244198526300bb0a158227d2f8724c701f79712b1b77d5bd52f8c6e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You expend massive amounts of energy to launch yourself across %d squares at incredible speed. All enemies in your path will be knocked flying and dealt between %d and %d Physical damage.\n\t\tAt talent level 5, you can batter through solid walls.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"消耗大量能量，以惊人的速度冲锋 %d 格。路径上的所有敌人会被击飞并受到 %d 至 %d 点物理伤害。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时你能冲过墙壁。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c4220b549d9a6a0189ac4f003dc2df9be538bd7d406a30d65a4805b5ca44ddb8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"878904aeef5e95d42cdfdacd9dcb4c76abb61adb837e68e54d0dc5a84b0c0d2e","logical_entry_identity":"1b51f0c8af4983ffadc2f47cb1ff6cb1a42250752af39395ed09740e0b549583","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"At long last, the temple finally reveals its secrets to me, and my plans can be set in motion. Lithe in form, faultless in combat, unmatched in speed both above the waves and beneath... nature couldn't have hoped to create such a race as nagas. With the Temple of Creation now open to me however, we may become so much more. With my guidance, my careful shaping of the Sher'Tul's magicks, under my expert hand our great race shall soon reach its zenith. A new tract shall soon be written: The Tract of the Devourer.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"终于，神庙向我敞开了神秘之门，我的计划终于可以实施了。柔软的身体，完美的战斗能力，无与伦比的两栖机动性……大自然怎么会创造出娜迦这样的种族？不管怎样，当造物主神庙之门为我打开，我们可以变的更加强大。在我的指引和对夏·图尔魔法的仔细改造下，我们的伟大种族会很快趋于巅峰。新的篇章即将写就：《吞噬者之卷》。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b0f4c6fa0ad6d470e114891aed38d988f1c22e19ba0aa5a808843f0295a495f5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8b977dd836b5b2d8da2faf8135f5244fcb524b72970486c31d2cdd20941f3fa1","logical_entry_identity":"6e866a2b0beb3b24c03d807061b9ba2ec2da817f1858e324ffcd9807d28a3346","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Most Archmagi have been trained in the secret town of Angolwen and possess a unique spell to teleport to it directly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"大多数元素法师在一个名叫安格利文的秘密小镇接受训练，并拥有一个直接传送到那里的独特技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"49b7f24b9734214a800f7984f2e1367e83db8de0bef4416b55e29e9c0e52a8ff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"94a92c6a5e26c9403be62a8d3eb2175f4906d01449059564281dbfe2b6e2c48d","logical_entry_identity":"4323caa1027cfd213d57e4ec76db95291cf629f0a0661f723fc1b2bbf44b8ad3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Till the Blood Runs Clear","source_tag":"_t","target":"直到鲜血流清"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"67f647f2210605b9301156204c585a38b97983e2462275304c52fbbb20e76dac","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"95868164c23e8bd8f6a4da4f03c8ee8e8ca2ac438ee3155659620d4925bd919b","logical_entry_identity":"cd0f5e5c8dad8811295e402caea49d28a7dfde2b166a392f1c0ad0d54e5301d5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This creature is about as tall as a halfling. It is covered in white silky fur and has a disproportionate head. The weirdest thing about it though, its weapon simply floats in front of it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只生物像半身人一样高。它浑身覆盖着白色的丝滑毛发，长着一颗不相称的大头。最不可思议的是，它的武器就那样悬浮在它面前。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e195dc8420a2588ebbc6ccccb125ddda9ddc9d0e054dd23f5483eba70d7a464c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4cb9b7bb1f06555d51b2e0e1e40f5c10ff1237be583dda44f4df357e8af49d6","logical_entry_identity":"893e0f8454e2b19407321fa36be95aadec0b105e8537bb0b1e66fc4758242c5b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bludgeoned","source_tag":"_t","target":"受到钝击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5650b5f432c5b31b811774fbab0c80ea8249d12b3a0f40aee8f3fb0707b9bda","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a55306c4f3e95030b711a47e50ab6d56c2466f5d0f0817079a09dab6ab68d924","logical_entry_identity":"d8b8f8c66112e4f0556ec617566b86da4dbc208e1720279fd0b9bf488618daf7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lay a magical trap that fires a beam of arcane energy at a random foe (within range 5) each turn for %d turns, inflicting %0.2f arcane damage.\nThis trap requires 20 Magic to prepare and does not refund stamina when it expires.\n#YELLOW#Activates immediately when placed.#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"放置魔法陷阱，每回合朝 5 格内的随机敌人射出奥术射线，持续 %d 回合，造成 %0.2f 奥术伤害。\n该陷阱需要 20 魔法才能准备，消失时不返还体力。\n#YELLOW#放置后立刻激活。#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06a07d2c1f7c15e6c19a123842f89a81a71ff5cbaece55dc8676c26db96900d0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a55357a9b92836df8b9cc6716cbbc60428c5dff777d156dd67ac407554f12eb5","logical_entry_identity":"24191af59a47f76174c2acd458272011892f136742196097e52ebb1b757e93f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#rng# the Spawn of Urh'Rok","source_tag":"_t","target":"#rng# 乌鲁洛克的子嗣"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6225d121df0e578c2ff9a018378bfd0f7a9f2ca20373affa701e1bea2abd756c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a554ba85938495d485336317b24fda1caccb1a4063c7edfd3de63937ab1eb1d5","logical_entry_identity":"b7b82e5707f6d23e67f284aecdb1464bddb4a7f43ba54d06a72681deceb52c3a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I want to help!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我想要帮忙！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2706426bca7b98f98deb65ee4b05f9ae4fa31747439566b8901106487cff6f04","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a557bec3dcd33235d14fdbfa452e67f3e30da0753b5bc80265a3a37681ba9bab","logical_entry_identity":"8418856e655f80280cfe7be11bcfa853a0fb2c1e29a5dac244e817ba5ee42f11","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Concentrate on the battle, ignoring some of the damage you take.\n\t\tImproves physical damage reduction by %d%% and provides a %d%% chance to shrug off critical damage for 20 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"专注于战斗并忽略你所承受的攻击。\n\t\t增加物理伤害减免 %d%% 同时有 %d%% 几率摆脱暴击伤害，持续 20 回合。"},{"args