d by one instead.\n\t\tThis effect can only happen once per turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"让阳光的怒火充满自身，增加 %d%% 物理和法术暴击率。\n\t\t每次物理或法术暴击时，有 %d%% 几率获得阳光之怒效果，持续两回合。\n\t\t当效果激活时，你的阳光烈焰变为瞬间技能，同时伤害增加 25%%。\n\t\t如果阳光烈焰处于冷却中，则减少 1 回合冷却时间。\n\t\t该效果一回合至多触发一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e35c9cd1c8c404a7edefaf4ba302467bc830d6881ea96d42178d97210b8009f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a57f6faeee9e90d21a91886480c5e3570a9257985a15396202a03a207646f19b","logical_entry_identity":"db1fa65b12e701ea13fafbe83706fbcf693e5d5bae25286dcf0779aa4007b32f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Protected by the Sun","source_tag":"_t","target":"被太阳保护"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"84bde9a1a2d9b2fe4229f6875d69b1977d4f4ff6a2a0f7de8f90b9586305348e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a584086d58f53c623f59aa4f07745a1bc7ecf5b4f8ccba38895c25e152a5f7ed","logical_entry_identity":"078253bb82fa652cdd04646dd539257fa2db0e7ec2d6fb157f57d300e4ba95e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"archer","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"弓道"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f96429da00604820a8b2831b7c7423d4a06b88d9ee20b98c5ef99bf3eed46477","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a595b9eca4b62a29b6428e4bb2a169718d06e6439a2157e8cc3ccac4758c5e8c","logical_entry_identity":"a55e189ecb2198e5ff62e030eac3f973f721dbed92a679a79397bcbb2bab1cbb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#No changes to trap preparation.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#陷阱准备未作更改。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"78bc4f18a5e5e06adc5cacea4a0bc877d7059398e0ebc291143621366b54ad32","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a59a575f2835c43eeb0e3ac55a7f2161e7d75cf5d4bf1c85eec53d4f053ec66d","logical_entry_identity":"193f12b9dcea47472f2bca8045224a6964bd4f0a3e5be966c14c2415ca1f1c40","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I do. The Ziguranth are not raving zealots, you know. We will look for a way to cure you, as long as you reject the blight.","source_